      "message": "If the host-\u003ehyp MMIO donation was per-device instead of per-page, I think you could avoid this walk entirely and track the state in the `pkvm_device` instead. As it stands, the locking is a little clunky because the device_spinlock is doing all the work and hyp_lock_component() in here is probably (?) not needed",
